&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:3.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;税理士事務所開設（現在）&lt;/p&gt;
